    "estimated": "3.00 occ x 60 min/occ (estimate, mid of 30-120, basis inferred, 3 quotes from 3 occurrences) = 180.00 min = 20.67 min/mo; automatable 60% (estimate) = 12.40 min/mo; at the low end 30 min/occ = $11.17/mo, at the high end 120 min/occ = $37.52/mo (the row's automatable total)",
    "total": "today 24.46 min/mo = 0.41 h/mo = $34.65/mo (email 3.79 min/mo = $5.37 + work 20.67 min/mo = $29.28); automatable 14.09 min/mo = 0.23 h/mo = $19.96/mo (counted email 1.69 min/mo = $2.39 + estimated work 12.40 min/mo = $17.57)"
